{'symbol': 'EXC', 'date': '2022-09-15 11:24:00', 'title': 'COMED, LEAGUE OF CHICAGO THEATRES AWARD $160,000 IN GRANT FUNDING TO 18 ARTS ORGANIZATIONS ACROSS NORTHERN ILLINOIS', 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AFTER TWO YEARS OF DISRUPTIONS DUE TO THE PANDEMIC, IN-PERSON PERFORMANCES AND THEATERS ARE BACK IN NORTHERN ILLINOIS. TO INCREASE ACCESS TO THE ARTS IN NORTHERN ILLINOIS, COMED AND THE LEAGUE OF CHICAGO THEATRES TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THEY HAVE AWARDED $160,000 IN FUNDING TO LOCAL COMMUNITY ARTS ORGANIZATIONS ACROSS THE REGION. THROUGH COMED'S ANNUAL POWERING THE ARTS PROGRAM, INDIVIDUAL GRANTS RANGING FROM $10,000-$25,000 WILL GO TO 18 NONPROFIT ORGANIZATIONS, INCLUDIN"}